    "summary": "Talos votes NO under Agent T voting policy v1.0, rule H4(a). The verified budget splits USD 1,831,000 into five equal 20% tranches with no cost per deliverable, so value for money cannot be judged. Milestones, custody, sweep-back, disclosure and NCL headroom pass."
